(text "/S=HEALTH_ALL; /R held HIGH; D=0. Fault asynchronously sets Q.\nRESET_REQUEST = HEALTH_ALL AND NOT ENABLE_IN.\n10k / 10n delays the rising reset clock; hold ENABLE low >=1 ms after recovery.\nFault or invalid supplies block DRIVE_PERMIT directly.\nRecovery with ENABLE high cannot clear the latch or restart PWM.\nFAULT_N is open collector; a fully unpowered inverter cannot assert LOW.\nVery short faults during reset may require a fresh disable cycle." (at 20.32 222.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed4e2bb9-5e17-5d5a-95ca-fef2f71d0215"))
